{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50717","headline":"题宛陵新桥兼献裴尚书 · 张祜","name":"题宛陵新桥兼献裴尚书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"富平津路远陵开，武库森森又姓裴。\n高步已吟携手句，上闻初喜造舟才。\n霜明华表尘初静，月正栏干斗乍回。\n犹忆醉歌南浦夜，五更人过万声雷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50717.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50717","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}